{
  "captions": [
    {
      "text": "A missed promise can become",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 1.38
    },
    {
      "text": "a harsh identity:",
      "start": 1.38,
      "end": 2.38
    },
    {
      "text": "I am a failure.",
      "start": 3.4,
      "end": 4.4
    },
    {
      "text": "Here is the understanding Uday",
      "start": 5.32,
      "end": 7.04
    },
    {
      "text": "explores in Mind Clarity.",
      "start": 7.04,
      "end": 8.8
    },
    {
      "text": "We are the Creator.",
      "start": 9.84,
      "end": 11.3
    },
    {
      "text": "We created this game of",
      "start": 12.28,
      "end": 13.52
    },
    {
      "text": "experiences and entered it.",
      "start": 13.52,
      "end": 15.34
    },
    {
      "text": "Having designed it before",
      "start": 16.16,
      "end": 17.24
    },
    {
      "text": "entering,",
      "start": 17.24,
      "end": 17.76
    },
    {
      "text": "we cannot change its design",
      "start": 18.26,
      "end": 19.92
    },
    {
      "text": "from inside the game.",
      "start": 19.92,
      "end": 21.26
    },
    {
      "text": "Here,",
      "start": 22.24,
      "end": 22.56
    },
    {
      "text": "Creator means the shared source",
      "start": 23.0,
      "end": 24.88
    },
    {
      "text": "in every life.",
      "start": 24.88,
      "end": 26.06
    },
    {
      "text": "Forgetting a call is an",
      "start": 26.06,
      "end": 28.1
    },
    {
      "text": "experience in a role.",
      "start": 28.1,
      "end": 29.36
    },
    {
      "text": "It is not the whole",
      "start": 30.0,
      "end": 30.96
    },
    {
      "text": "of who you are.",
      "start": 30.96,
      "end": 31.82
    },
    {
      "text": "You cannot undo that scene.",
      "start": 32.34,
      "end": 34.08
    },
    {
      "text": "Yet apologising and making a",
      "start": 34.74,
      "end": 36.84
    },
    {
      "text": "new arrangement are also part",
      "start": 36.84,
      "end": 38.84
    },
    {
      "text": "of the game.",
      "start": 38.84,
      "end": 39.4
    },
    {
      "text": "Recognising the same Creator in",
      "start": 40.32,
      "end": 42.2
    },
    {
      "text": "the person affected gives that",
      "start": 42.2,
      "end": 44.0
    },
    {
      "text": "care its meaning.",
      "start": 44.0,
      "end": 45.2
    },
    {
      "text": "Can you acknowledge the mistake",
      "start": 45.96,
      "end": 47.48
    },
    {
      "text": "without making it your whole",
      "start": 47.48,
      "end": 48.9
    },
    {
      "text": "identity?",
      "start": 48.9,
      "end": 49.38
    },
    {
      "text": "Pause,",
      "start": 50.14,
      "end": 50.82
    },
    {
      "text": "remember,",
      "start": 51.36,
      "end": 51.64
    },
    {
      "text": "and notice honestly.",
      "start": 52.32,
      "end": 53.52
    }
  ],
